  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participatory and Inclusive Land Conflict Management in Burkina Faso &#x2013; Phase II (PILand II).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving equitable and inclusive land, natural resource governance and justice in Burkina Faso. Building on PILAND I (Fund Code: 91629), the program will support local initiatives for the prevention and management of land conflicts to achieve a more equitable and inclusive handling of conflicts related to land and natural resources. This will be achieved by leveraging the results of the participatory action research to mitigate and resolve land and natural resource conflicts from the PILand phase I. The program also aims to enhance community resilience to the effects of climate change on their livelihoods, through support for inputs, and installation/construction of hydraulic structures.</narrative>
  </description>
